+# TFLite Model Files — Download Required
+
+The `.tflite` files here are **placeholders**. Replace them with real models before building for production.
+
+## Quick Download (run from this folder)
+
+```bash
+# 1. BlazeFace (face detection ~320KB)
+curl -L "https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_detector/blaze_face_short_range/float16/1/blaze_face_short_range.tflite" -o blazeface.tflite
+
+# 2. Blink / Iris detector (~500KB)  
+curl -L "https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/iris_landmark/iris_landmark/float16/1/iris_landmark.tflite" -o blink_detector.tflite
+
+# 3. MobileFaceNet INT8 (~3.5MB) — download from:
+# https://github.com/sirius-ai/MobileFaceNet_TF/releases
+# Rename the downloaded file to: mobilefacenet_int8.tflite
+```
+
+## Without real models
+The app runs in **demo mode** — camera is shown, face detection is simulated. All UI works.
